WEBVTT

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:16.870
<i>I take small breaths</i>

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.500
<i>just like the blind fish...</i>

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.290
<i>found deep in the ocean.</i>

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.000
<i>My scales are black,</i>

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:29.500
<i>and the darkness</i>
<i>hides even my twisted smile.</i>

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.910
<i>I take small breaths.</i>

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:37.540
<i>In order to feast upon the flesh</i>

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:39.370
<i>of you fools.</i>

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:07.580
Hey!

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.370
That's Ms. Mario's wallet!

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:11.870
Is that right?

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.950
Well, then,
why don't I see her name on it,

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:17.620
little lady?

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.620
Well...

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:24.080
You burst into our hideout

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:25.910
and make a baseless accusation?

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:27.910
It's not baseless!

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:31.000
Besides, it's not your wallet, is it?

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.870
But it's Ms. Mario's...

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.660
Then I can't very well hand it to you.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:37.910
But that's...

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.620
Lizzy, don't bully her, just give it back.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:44.200
Really?
You're going to defend the little lady?

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.160
Naji, don't tell me

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.290
she's your girlfriend.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.700
-Girlfriend?
-Girlfriend!

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:53.410
You sound like my grandpa!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:56.750
What? Don't lump me in
with your stupid old man!

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:59.040
Hey, don't be so coarse.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:01.160
You're a girl after all, Lizzy.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:03.540
A girl?

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:12.040
How about it?
This would be a perfect fit for you.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.700
Why don't you quit
that silly army and come work for me?

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.500
No, thank you.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:19.700
"Silly army"?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:21.910
Seriously, silly?

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:25.290
I mean, yes, I'd like to fire a cannon
once in a while, too...

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:27.870
Yo, Aisha, someone get under your skin?

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:30.790
Darn it, I wanna charge a hill
with a tank!

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.790
That 105 millimeter cannon is calling my--

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:35.000
I mean, we should celebrate
a job well done!

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.200
Yeah? You, too, Kidow!

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.120
-No.
-No.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:38.160
What?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:42.000
Don't copy me, uppity Exterminator!

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:46.200
Come on, let's let off some steam tonight!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:51.160
Sorry about them, Mr. Kidow.
They should know better.

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:53.790
Here, this is from the Bazaar Overseer.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.790
He said he threw in a little extra!

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:00.830
Why does the Exterminator get so much?

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:02.620
Now, now.

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:05.370
We made it back unharmed thanks to him.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.040
I'll come for drinks.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.080
Really? Then you'll foot the bill?

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.200
What, it's my treat?

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:14.830
All right!

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:17.830
You're a girl?

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:19.830
What if I am?

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.830
Can't a girl be the leader
of a band of thieves?

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:26.790
A band of thieves?
You're just a bunch of pickpockets.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.450
Say what you want.

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:31.660
We're still much better off
than a prissy little girl

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.950
who can't do anything on her own.

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:36.750
I'm not like that!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Prissy little girl!

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.250
Wearing your nice clothes,
everyone doting on you.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:46.450
People around you always saving you.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.000
I'm jealous.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:49.580
Prissy little girl!

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:53.080
Why don't you make your way back home now,
little girl. Shoo, shoo.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.120
I need the wallet back.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.160
Then how about this?

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:04.000
Let's play tag.

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:07.700
You can have the wallet back
if you can catch us.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:09.120
Why do I have to do that?

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.200
Can't handle it?

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:12.410
Just as I thought.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.500
I mean, you do look slow.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.080
Now you've done it.
I'll catch every last one of you!

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:22.200
You can try.

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:26.450
Here I come!

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:30.290
Catch us if you can!

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:36.370
Hi, Ilie--

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.290
Oh, it's just Kidow.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.000
Welcome home.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:42.040
Sorry it's just me.

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:44.450
Where is she?

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:48.290
I sent her on a shopping errand.
She should be back soon.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.500
Oh, my.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.790
You wanted to see her first thing
when you got back? Oh, Kidow.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.450
It's not like that.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:59.750
Stop acting so coy!

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:20.450
<i>I take small breaths.</i>

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.290
<i>My scales are black.</i>

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:27.410
<i>The darkness hides even my twisted smile.</i>

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.540
Hey! Get back here!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.580
We're over here, slowpoke!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.410
-Thanks for the food!
-Here we go!

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.450
You little brats!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.500
Oh, sorry, little lady!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.830
No, excuse me.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:54.830
Hey! Give those back!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:06:59.950
So lame!

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:01.160
Ouch!

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.040
See? We gave them back!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.330
Darn it, what is wrong with you?

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:07.540
Run away!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.950
Hey! Get back here!

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.620
Stop right now!

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.500
-Come on, over here!
-This way!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:27.870
Stop!

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.750
-Okay, let's split up!
-This way!

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:31.120
Roger that!

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.160
-Right!
-Okay!

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.700
Wait! Okay, this way!

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:36.910
Hold it!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.450
That's nothing!

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:00.580
Oh, no!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.200
What a loser.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:10.330
See you later!

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:15.160
-Ilie! Lizzy!
-Lizzy!

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.660
Come on, where did they go?

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:20.250
Naji, Naji.

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:22.410
What is it, Romus?

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:29.830
She molted?

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:37.660
Here.

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.830
That'll do it. Thanks for your business!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.290
What's that?

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.290
Don't tell me it's a love letter
or something!

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.200
Let's see.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:55.290
The West Gate watchtower?

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.500
Pretty crazy place to meet a date.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:08:59.410
So?

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:00.370
What's this map?

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:02.540
There's a bunch of markings here.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.290
Locations the "meatballs" were found.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:08.790
There are even notes on which parts
were dismembered.

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:11.910
Wait, does that mean...?

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:16.910
The only one who would know those details
is the killer.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:21.580
Just call it a day!
Nothing good can come of pursuing this!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.910
-What are you doing?
-Naji!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.000
Hey, kid!

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.660
Stop! Let go of me!

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.450
Where are this thing's contents?

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:50.910
So, she finally gave up?

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:04.830
There's nowhere left to run!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.200
No way!

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:10.830
I got you!

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:14.080
Aren't you embarrassed
walking around like that?

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:16.660
Losing to you would be
much more embarrassing!

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:20.080
Darn it! You're supposed to be
a prissy little girl!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:23.000
Too bad, I'm not as prissy as you thought!

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.790
Believe it or not,
I was a shepherd in Area A.

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.950
Compared to runaway sheep,

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:30.500
catching you was no problem.

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:33.410
Area A? That's the boonies!

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.500
-Don't make fun of my home!
-Stop that!

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:38.040
Ouch! Okay, okay!

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.910
I give up! You win!

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:41.830
Yes!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:45.660
Come on.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.870
Why aren't you the one with the wallet?

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:52.120
Well, I figured you'd chase after me,
if anyone.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.040
You read me like a book.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.580
We're supposed to meet by the watchtower.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.830
Come on, it's not like you've got plans.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.830
I bet Ms. Mario is worried.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.250
Kidow might be back by now, too.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:08.000
Hey, can I ask you something?

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:11.250
Did you come all the way here
from the backwoods

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:13.080
of Area A all on your own?

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:14.620
No.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:16.080
I came with my dad.

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:17.870
But...

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.700
We got attacked by bugs on the way,

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:24.580
and my dad died.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:28.540
I see.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.790
Then you're no different from us.

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:36.830
Naji already told you, right?

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:40.000
This was where we were born.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:46.700
The most beautiful sunset in all of 05,
right?

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:48.290
So, you're aware.

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:51.000
What's your name?

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:52.410
It's Ilie.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.120
All right, Ilie.

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:57.200
Starting today,
you're part of Team Red Rats.

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:04.410
-What? Let go, you bastard!
-Stop struggling!

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:05.580
Hey, kid.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.830
Tell me where you found this.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:11.080
I don't know! Now let me go!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:12.830
Tag.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.080
Lizzy likes the sunset.

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:18.660
Her favorite

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:21.500
is the sunset by the West Gate watchtower.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.750
I'm sure that girl is with her, too.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.910
Kidow, isn't that...?

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:27.160
I know.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.750
Ouch!

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:32.870
That kid's going to complicate things
even further!

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:39.290
They sure are taking their sweet time.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:42.910
<i>Little Bo Peep</i>

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:47.620
<i>Has lost her sheep</i>

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.870
-I can't just leave it to that guy!
-Naji!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:56.160
There's only one adult
who'll listen to us!

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:58.750
Dang it.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:12:59.790
Qasim!

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.660
Oh, it's you guys.

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:07.580
Sorry about that. You okay?

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:10.500
What was that for?

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.000
Whatever, this is important!

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.120
Qasim, there's trouble! The mutilated--

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:15.950
Lizzy, Lizzy is--

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:18.580
No, the murderer! The mutilating murderer!

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:19.830
What?

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:23.410
What the heck, Lizzy?

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:24.950
She actually caught you?

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:29.000
Sorry, Nim,
this one has some serious guts.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:33.500
She's part of Team Red Rats now,
so be nice to her, okay?

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:34.410
Okay!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.790
I thought I told you I'm not joining!

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.040
So, where's the wallet?

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:39.580
Iason.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.290
Nice one!

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:42.500
Come on...

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:45.660
You can't be serious...

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:50.410
<i>Little Bo Peep</i>

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:55.200
<i>Has lost her sheep</i>

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:03.910
<i>And can't tell where to find them</i>

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:09.000
<i>Leave them alone</i>

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:12.500
<i>And they'll come home</i>

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:39.830
Help!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.410
Take that and get out of here!

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:55.450
I'm the one you're here for, right?

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:58.200
You sick freak.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:03.080
What took you so long,
Far Eastern Exterminator?

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:08.700
What was that?

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.200
Gunfire?

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:16.580
Iason?

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:23.080
How did the Exterminators taste?

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:26.580
To think I'd get a written invitation...

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:30.290
I really appreciate it, you freak.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.200
Not a single one of them was satisfying.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.290
How will you stack up?

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:54.120
I can't help if you keep crying.

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:56.580
What happened, Iason?

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:00.540
Some weird guy in a mask...

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.910
almost killed me.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:04.830
What did you say?

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.750
Wait, is that mine?

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.120
Some pointy-haired guy

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:18.580
told me to take it with me!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.500
"Pointy-haired"?

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:22.500
Kidow?

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:35.500
You hunt Cagasters, don't you?

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:40.370
Willingly fighting those monsters...

00:16:44.660 --> 00:16:46.580
makes you a freak, too!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:55.660
What!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:17:00.250
There are some who say
you guys aren't human either.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:03.540
But I'd say you are.

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:17.450
You're a human child
made for preying upon.

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:42.250
Wow, I'm surprised you dodged that.

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:49.080
That was supposed to
slice your belly open.

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:56.040
Look closely, human.
The real predator here...

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:57.660
is me!

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:26.120
As an Exterminator, I'm sure you're aware.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.870
This poison won't kill you.

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:34.540
It will just dull your senses
and make you sleepy.

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:40.790
What are you, you bastard? That body...

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:44.660
That's all?

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:47.620
I thought you'd be a bit more surprised.

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:50.290
<i>Cagaster legs.</i>

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:52.540
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:54.750
<i>He's had a Cagaster outbreak,</i>

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:57.290
<i>but still retained his mind.</i>

00:18:58.250 --> 00:18:59.750
<i>What does that make him?</i>

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:04.500
I was getting tired
of screaming Exterminators.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.450
Let's see how long you can keep your cool.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.750
I'll be sure to take my time
dissecting you.

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:15.200
Our time together will be short,

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:17.700
but let's get along, Exterminator.

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:25.540
Somebody! Somebody come help!

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:27.620
Help!

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.700
So many uninvited guests today.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:30.620
Wait!

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:32.000
Stop!

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:36.290
You damn idiot.

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:38.040
Run already!

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:40.410
Somebody! Somebody help--

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.160
Good evening,

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.160
my soft-looking little lady.

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:06.450
I... Ilie?

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:16.290
Second cervical vertebra.

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:18.580
Atlas and axis vertebrae.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:22.250
Target the nerve fibers in between.

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:51.040
That was your only weak point, wasn't it?

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:52.750
Damn Cagasters...

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:01.910
Kidow! Kidow!

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:04.910
Wake up, Kidow!

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:10.000
What? Does it hurt? Where? Here?

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.250
Shut up, I'm just sleepy.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.080
Stop yelling in my ear.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:17.700
Where did he go?

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.910
I don't know. He screamed and ran away.

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:25.120
He's still alive?
He seriously is a monster.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.700
Kidow, are you really okay?

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:32.040
Yeah, just let me rest.
Five minutes should do it.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:33.450
I can't move.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:40.120
What about you?

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:43.580
I'm asking if you're hurt.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:45.910
No, I'm okay.

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:48.120
I was really scared, though.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:50.370
Okay.

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:53.120
That's good.

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:10.410
You know, Kidow...

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:12.620
I...

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:15.290
I...

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:18.620
I don't really know for sure yet...

00:22:20.660 --> 00:22:22.660
but I think so, too...

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:27.500
Kidow.

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:33.370
Hey, Ilie!

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:35.250
-Ilie!
-Ilie!

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:37.410
Ilie!

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:38.660
I'll go look over there.

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:40.410
-Okay!
-Ilie!

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:41.870
Are you dead, Exterminator?

00:22:41.950 --> 00:22:44.790
-Ilie!
-If you're dead, say something!

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:49.910
Kidow...

00:23:06.540 --> 00:23:08.410
Did something good happen,

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:09.950
Acht?

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:14.160
Ilie...

00:25:21.370 --> 00:25:23.870
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
